      "mergeID": "5b527e7c719ca855314d0bc4",
      "mergedPostDetails": "As the title says, a way to link Steam / VRChat accounts to each other, or migrate from a Steam account to a VRChat account, giving Steam users an option to create their own avatars, but also keep the friends list / favorite worlds.\n\n\nI know things like this are already on here, though mostly scattered around and asking for 1 particular part of it. If this is a duplicate of an other (which is possible, only seen about 20 \"suggested posts\". Although \"Connect Steam to VRChat Account\" is very similar if not the same), feel free to remove this.\n\nAn example is the way Gaijin can link Steam / Gaijin accounts.",
